<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Steel sees 30 bln yen profit in '97/98.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Steel sees 30 bln yen profit in '97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kawasaki Steel Corp said on Thursday that it aims to post a parent current profit of around 30 billion yen in the 1997/98 business year.</p>
<p>It also said it plans capital expenditure of 40 billion yen in 1997/98.</p>
</text>
